Before setting defaults:
  foreground   effective: (not set)  default: (not set)
  background   effective: (not set)  default: (not set)
  cursor       effective: (not set)  default: (not set)
  palette[0]   effective: #1D1F21  default: #1D1F21

After setting defaults:
  foreground   effective: #DDDDDD  default: #DDDDDD
  background   effective: #1E1E2E  default: #1E1E2E
  cursor       effective: #F5E0DC  default: #F5E0DC
  palette[0]   effective: #45475A  default: #45475A

After OSC foreground override:
  foreground   effective: #FF0000  default: #DDDDDD
  background   effective: #1E1E2E  default: #1E1E2E
  cursor       effective: #F5E0DC  default: #F5E0DC
  palette[0]   effective: #45475A  default: #45475A

After clearing foreground default:
  foreground   effective: #FF0000  default: (not set)
  background   effective: #1E1E2E  default: #1E1E2E
  cursor       effective: #F5E0DC  default: #F5E0DC
  palette[0]   effective: #45475A  default: #45475A
